{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/publishDiagnostics", "params": {"uri": "file:///t/pipe.flow", "diagnostics": [{"range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 2}}, "severity": 1, "source": "flow-parser", "message": "parse error: unexpected identifier 'xs'"}]}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`|>`** - pipe / pipeline operator.\n\nFeeds the left-hand value into the right-hand call or declarative form.\n\n```flow\nxs |> sort\nxs |> sortBy [desc .score, asc .name]\nvalue |> abs\n```\nSee docs/language/syntax.md (and docs/language/ordering.md when present)."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`|>`** - pipe / pipeline operator.\n\nFeeds the left-hand value into the right-hand call or declarative form.\n\n```flow\nxs |> sort\nxs |> sortBy [desc .score, asc .name]\nvalue |> abs\n```\nSee docs/language/syntax.md (and docs/language/ordering.md when present)."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`sort`** - declarative ordering (Phase 1).\n\n```flow\nxs |> sort\nxs |> sort descending\nxs |> sort by .score\nxs |> sortBy [desc .score, asc .name]\n```\nIn-place on `array<T, N>`. See docs/language/ordering.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": null}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/publishDiagnostics", "params": {"uri": "file:///t/match.flow", "diagnostics": [{"range": {"start": {"line": 2, "character": 16}, "end": {"line": 2, "character": 17}}, "severity": 1, "source": "flow-parser", "message": "parse error: unexpected token '=>'"}]}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 6, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`match`** - pattern matching on a value.\n\n```flow\nmatch day {\n    1 => print(\"Mon\")\n    default => print(\"other\")\n}\n```\nSee docs/language/syntax.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`default`** - catch-all arm in a `match`.\n\n```flow\nmatch x {\n    0 => 1\n    default => x\n}\n```"}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 8, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`=>`** - match-arm / closure arrow.\n\n```flow\nmatch x {\n    0 => print(\"zero\")\n    default => print(\"other\")\n}\n```\nSee docs/language/syntax.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 9, "result": null}
