{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "```flow\nfunction double(x: i32) -> i32\n```\n\nDouble the input value\nUsed by tests\n\n*typechecked function:* `(i32) -> i32`"}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 11, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`function`** - declare a function.\n\n```flow\nfunction add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {\n    return a + b\n}\n```\nSee docs/language/functions.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 12, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`i32`** - signed 32-bit integer.\n\nSee docs/language/types.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 13, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`->`** - function return type or effect/sense binding arrow.\n\n```flow\nfunction add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 { return a + b }\ncontrollable -> plant_ok\n```\nSee docs/language/functions.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 14, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "```flow\nx: i32\n```\n\nParameter *(typechecked)* in `double`"}}}
