{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 32, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`@gpu`** - mark a function as a GPU kernel / offload candidate.\n\n```flow\n@gpu\nfunction saxpy(n: i32, a: f32, x: ptr<f32>, y: ptr<f32>) -> void { ... }\n```\nSee docs/tutorials/advanced.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 33, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`@gpu`** - mark a function as a GPU kernel / offload candidate.\n\n```flow\n@gpu\nfunction saxpy(n: i32, a: f32, x: ptr<f32>, y: ptr<f32>) -> void { ... }\n```\nSee docs/tutorials/advanced.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 34, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`@lifetime(D)`** - lifetime domain: `callback`, `frame`, `session` or `application`, shortest-lived first. Goes on a function (the domain its frame runs in) or a module static (the domain of that storage, default `application`).\n\n```flow\n@lifetime(callback)\nfunction process(input: span<f32>) -> f32 { ... }\n```\n`callback` implies `@rt_safe`; `frame` forbids heap create/destroy but allows bumping an arena. A longer-lived domain may not hold a reference to a shorter-lived one.\n\nSee docs/language/lifetime-domains.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 35, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`vec`** - short vector type (SIMD / graphics).\n\nSee docs/language/types.md and docs/language/graphics.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "textDocument/publishDiagnostics", "params": {"uri": "file:///t/dsl.flow", "diagnostics": [{"range": {"start": {"line": 0, "character": 0}, "end": {"line": 0, "character": 3}}, "severity": 1, "source": "flow-parser", "message": "parse error: unexpected identifier 'dyn'"}]}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 36, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`dsys`** - declare a linear plant (dynamics DSL).\n\n```flow\ndyn.dsys plant {\n    discrete   # or continuous\n    dt 0.1\n    n 2 m 1 p 1\n    A 1.0 0.1 0.0 1.0\n    B 0.0 0.1\n    C 1.0 0.0\n}\n```\nPrefixed form: `dyn.dsys` / `dynamics.dsys`. See docs/language/dynamics-dsl.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 37, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`dyn.`** - short namespace prefix for dynamics DSL constructs (`dyn.dsys`, `dyn.horizon`, `dyn.sense`, `dyn.ga`, `dyn.closed`, `dyn.analyze`, `dyn.wfc`)."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 38, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "Plant is discrete-time: `x[k+1] = A x[k] + B u[k]`."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 39, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`sortBy`** - multi-key ordering alias for `sort by [...]`.\n\n```flow\nxs |> sortBy [asc .score, asc .name]\n```"}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 40, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "`desc .field` - descending key in a sort key list."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 41, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`for`** - counted loop (`for i in lo to hi` / `step`).\n\n```flow\nfor i in 0 to 10 {\n    print(i)\n}\nfor i in 0 to 10 step 2 { }\n```\nSee docs/language/syntax.md."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 42, "result": null}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 43, "result": null}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 44, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "```flow\nfunction print(value: any) -> void\n```\n\nPrint a value to stdout."}}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 45, "result": {"contents": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "**`array<T, N>`** - fixed-size array type.\n\n```flow\nlet xs: array<i32, 4> = [1, 2, 3, 4]\n```\nSee docs/language/types.md."}}}
